        "title": "Lauthuan neimik kumma ganmei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lauthuan neimik kum ganmei pu,",
            "Kei puinung sangaimei suni;",
            "Guang puni the tingkauh thanmei nunle kamei,",
            "Champan jianmei nun le.",
            "",
            "2. Hei kandih rianra pui ram khou hei,",
            "Ntam lak nipui bam kandih khouhei makge;",
            "Pou !@9 damloumei kandih nai,",
            "Neilana bammei tei aniu lani,",
            "Arup jianmei nun le.",
            "",
            "3. Lauthuan tingjin tei tat man kan the,",
            "Aniu panti guang puni the;",
            "Tingkauh Jerusalem than gaimei namdai khou,",
            "Neilana sangaimei tei aniu lani,",
            "Champan jianmei nun le.",
            "",
            "4. Jianmei nun tei ariu ni kauh thang,",
            "Kandih ringmei thingbang lim khou;",
            "Neilamei luthan tei suan ni halleluijah,",
            "Raguang jan tei sinna aniu lani,",
            "Champan jianmei nun le."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
